      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Persistence in LangGraph is a built-in layer that automatically saves and restores the \nstate of your agent or graph workflow over time. It works by using a \ncheckpointer to automatically capture snapshots of the graph's state \nat every step, organizing them into unique, retrievable threads.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Persistence in LangGraph is a built-in layer that automatically saves and restores the \nstate of your agent or graph workflow over time. It works by using a \ncheckpointer to automatically capture snapshots of the graph's state \nat every step, organizing them into unique, retrievable threads.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
